WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.595
Brian: Hey, Ricky. Do you want to play baseball?

2
00:00:06.596 --> 00:00:12.893
Ricky: I can't. I have to do something.

3
00:00:12.894 --> 00:00:18.606
Be nice. Be friendly. Kitty:

4
00:00:18.607 --> 00:00:26.096
Just a moment.

5
00:00:26.097 --> 00:00:32.946
Ricky: Uh, Kitty, I, uh, well, I, uh . . .

6
00:00:32.947 --> 00:00:39.248
Kitty: Leave me alone, Ricky.

7
00:00:39.249 --> 00:00:42.635
Ricky: Here. I got you a gift.

8
00:00:42.636 --> 00:00:44.757
Kitty: What is it?

9
00:00:44.758 --> 00:00:48.314
Veronica: Why, that's Richard!

10
00:00:48.315 --> 00:00:52.955
What is he doing? Ricky:

11
00:00:52.956 --> 00:00:56.934
I promise to be nicer to you. Kitty:

12
00:00:56.935 --> 00:01:00.293
Well, thank you for the gift.

13
00:01:00.294 --> 00:01:06.594
Ricky: So, can we be friends again?

14
00:01:06.595 --> 00:01:13.437
Kitty: Yes, we're friends again.

15
00:01:13.438 --> 00:01:20.850
Veronica: Oh my goodness! Ricky likes Kitty!

